---
title: Category balances request sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(173,216,230) Compute
        participant LegendCompute as Compute
        participant CardServicingUi as Card Servicing UI
        participant ApiGateway as API gateway
        participant CardServicingService as Card Servicing service
    end
    box rgb(144,238,144) Data stores
        participant LegendDataStores as Data stores
        participant AzureManagedRedis as Azure Managed Redis
    end
    box rgb(211,211,211) External systems
        participant LegendExternal as External systems
        participant AuthService as Auth service
        participant ConfigService as Config service
        participant CardDataService as Card Data service
        participant ReferenceDataService as Reference Data
    end
    box rgb(244,204,204) Security
        participant LegendSecurity as Security
        participant AccountAccessGuard as Account access guard
    end
    box rgb(255,255,224) Networking
        participant LegendNetworking as Networking
    end

    CardServicingUi->>ApiGateway: GET category balances
    ApiGateway->>CardServicingService: Forward request with bearer token
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Start 900 ms deadline<br/>and traceId
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Read held<br/>configuration snapshot
    CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Validate accountId<br/>11 digits not all zero<br/>and typeCode pattern
    break invalid parameter
        CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 400 fixed
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 400 ErrorObject INVALID_ARGUMENT
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 400 ErrorObject, no upstream or Config call
    end

    CardServicingService->>AccountAccessGuard: Check bearer token and account access
    break token missing, empty or not Bearer
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 401 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Deny with 401, no Auth call
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 401 ErrorObject UNAUTHENTICATED
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 401 ErrorObject
    end
    AccountAccessGuard->>AuthService: ValidateToken
    break token invalid, expired or malformed
        AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: UNAUTHENTICATED
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 401 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Deny with 401
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 401 ErrorObject UNAUTHENTICATED
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 401 ErrorObject
    end
    break Auth unavailable or deadline spent
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 503 or 504 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Fail closed after retries
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504 ErrorObject
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 or 504 ErrorObject
    end
    AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: Subject and roles

    AccountAccessGuard->>AuthService: AuthorizeAccountAccess for subject and accountId
    break allowed false
        AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: allowed false
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 403 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Deny with 403, no data read
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 403 ErrorObject PERMISSION_DENIED
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 403 ErrorObject
    end
    break Auth unavailable or deadline spent
        AccountAccessGuard->>AccountAccessGuard: Mark cut-off now,<br/>outcome 503 or 504 fixed
        AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Fail closed, no data read
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504 ErrorObject
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 or 504 ErrorObject
    end
    AuthService-->>AccountAccessGuard: allowed true
    AccountAccessGuard-->>CardServicingService: Access allowed

    opt stale configuration snapshot
        CardServicingService-)ConfigService: GetConfig background refresh, not awaited
    end

    par category balances
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Read cached category balances
        AzureManagedRedis-->>CardServicingService: Fresh entry, stale entry or miss
        opt miss or stale entry
            CardServicingService->>CardDataService: ListCategoryBalances
            CardDataService-->>CardServicingService: Category balances or error
            CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Store balances with cachedAt on success
        end
    and transaction categories
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Read cached transaction categories
        AzureManagedRedis-->>CardServicingService: Fresh entry, stale entry or miss
        opt miss or stale entry
            CardServicingService->>ReferenceDataService: ListTransactionCategories
            ReferenceDataService-->>CardServicingService: Categories with descriptions or error
            CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Store categories with cachedAt on success
        end
    and transaction types
        CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Read cached transaction types
        AzureManagedRedis-->>CardServicingService: Fresh entry, stale entry or miss
        opt miss or stale entry
            CardServicingService->>ReferenceDataService: ListTransactionTypes
            ReferenceDataService-->>CardServicingService: Types with descriptions or error
            CardServicingService->>AzureManagedRedis: Store types with cachedAt on success
        end
    end

    alt unknown typeCode, category list usable
        CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Discard data read,<br/>outcome 400
    else no usable category list
        CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Skip typeCode check,<br/>apply filter,<br/>mark PARTIAL
    else typeCode known or absent
        CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Apply typeCode filter<br/>and label descriptions
    end

    Note over CardServicingService: Cut-off at or before 900 ms

    alt unknown typeCode, category list usable
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 400 ErrorObject for typeCode
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 400 ErrorObject
    else category balances read or served stale
        CardServicingService->>CardServicingService: Sort by typeCode<br/>and categoryCode,<br/>resolve dataStatus
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 200 balances, dataStatus FRESH, STALE or PARTIAL
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 200 with X-Data-Status, null descriptions if PARTIAL
    else account unknown
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 404 ErrorObject NOT_FOUND
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 404 ErrorObject
    else balances failed with no stale entry
        CardServicingService-->>ApiGateway: 503 or 504 ErrorObject
        ApiGateway-->>CardServicingUi: 503 or 504 ErrorObject
    end

    Note over LegendCompute,LegendNetworking: The service checks the token and account<br/>access, then reads the account's category<br/>balances, the category descriptions and the<br/>type descriptions concurrently through the<br/>cache. An unknown typeCode returns 400 while<br/>the category list is usable, and missing<br/>descriptions give PARTIAL.
